00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:04.370
Kagami ni senaka mukete ayumu hodo ni toozakaru yume yo 
Back to the mirror, my dream getting farther with every step I take

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.880
Massugu kimi to mukiaitai 
I want to come face-to-face with you

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:15.510
Dekinai jibun e to "never mind" 
Saying to the incapable version of myself, "never mind"

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:23.140
Ahiru no Sora

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:29.360
Nagare sagyou de waketeyuku yume 
A dream slowly dismantled on the assembly line

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.610
Muki? Fumuki? Iwaba rongai? 
(Suitable? Unsuitable? Pretty much impossible?)

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:37.030
Koe mo naku kietetta koe 
True feelings gone missing without a whisper

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.030
Tameiki sura denai 
(Not even capable of a sigh)

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:46.250
Hito no sei ni shitatte owarenai 
None of it will end by placing the blame on others

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.210
Me no mae ni kiritatta ima 
Right now, in the face of a steep slope

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:54.260
"Koetai" to kokoro ga sakenderu 
My heart cries out for me to "overcome it"

00:01:54.260 --> 00:02:01.800
Dekinai wake o sagasu nara daredemo dekiru sa 
Finding excuses not to try is something that anybody can do

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:09.350
Agaki hashitta sono saki mada shiranai jibun to deau 
Pushing myself to run beyond, I went to meet a me I've never known

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:15.690
Kabe ni kizamikonda rakugaki to "never mind" 
There's graffiti etched on the wall that says "never mind"

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:19.780
Ima asu e to hazume 
Now, I bounce into tomorrow

